 "wiki": {
  "pages": [
   {
    "id": "overview",
    "kind": "overview",
    "title": "Overview",
    "summary": "A moth spirit climbs out of a burned forest toward the moon.",
    "body": "A small moth spirit wakes in the ashes of a forest that has burned down. Something in the sky still shines: the moon. The game is a quiet, atmospheric metroidvania about climbing: from the [[ash_floor]], up through the [[hollow_trees]], to the [[moonlit_canopy]].\n\n## Tone\nHushed, melancholy, then slowly hopeful. Grey ash and ember-glow at the bottom; cold silver light at the top. Little dialogue; the world tells the story.\n\n## Themes\n- Grief and renewal after fire.\n- Light as both lure and guide: a moth is drawn to it, and it may be drawn to its ruin.\n- Ascent as recovery.\n\n## Structure\nThree regions, climbed bottom to top. The [[cinder_queen]] guards the hollow trees and holds the way up.\n\n## Cast\n- [[wanderer]]: the player, the moth spirit.\n- [[crawler]] and [[charger]]: the burned forest's ember-driven creatures.\n- [[cinder_queen]]: boss of the hollow trees.",
    "fields": {},
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "wanderer",
    "kind": "character",
    "title": "Wanderer",
    "summary": "The moth spirit the player controls, climbing toward the moon.",
    "body": "The Wanderer is a moth spirit born from the ashes of the burned forest. It has no voice and no memory of what the forest was, only a pull toward the moon.\n\nIt is fragile but agile, and grows by gaining abilities on its climb through the [[ash_floor]], the [[hollow_trees]] and the [[moonlit_canopy]]. Its path is blocked by the forest's creatures, such as the [[crawler]] and [[charger]], and by the [[cinder_queen]].",
    "fields": {
     "role": "player character",
     "appearance": "A small pale moth spirit, dusty wings, faintly glowing",
     "motivation": "Drawn upward to the moon; it does not fully know why"
    },
    "characterId": "player",
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "crawler",
    "kind": "character",
    "title": "Crawler",
    "summary": "A slow ember-backed bug that patrols the scorched ground.",
    "body": "Crawlers are small charred beetle-kin, their shells cracked and glowing with embers. They creep along the ground and trunks in set patterns, and attack only by touch.\n\nThey are the first threat the [[wanderer]] meets, in the [[ash_floor]], and teach the player to read patrol routes. They serve the [[cinder_queen]] as her brood.",
    "fields": {
     "role": "enemy",
     "behavior": "Patrols surfaces slowly; harms on contact",
     "habitat": "Ash floor, hollow trees"
    },
    "characterId": "crawler",
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "charger",
    "kind": "character",
    "title": "Charger",
    "summary": "A fast, aggressive ember-beast that rushes the player on sight.",
    "body": "Chargers are larger, heavier cinder-beetles with hardened horns. They stand still until the [[wanderer]] enters their line of sight, then rush in a straight line and need a moment to recover.\n\nThey are the guard of the [[hollow_trees]] and the [[cinder_queen]]'s soldiers. Their charge can be dodged and used against them.",
    "fields": {
     "role": "enemy",
     "behavior": "Spots the player, then charges in a straight line",
     "habitat": "Hollow trees"
    },
    "characterId": "charger",
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "cinder_queen",
    "kind": "character",
    "title": "Cinder Beetle Queen",
    "summary": "The ember-hearted queen who guards the hollow trees.",
    "body": "A huge cinder beetle whose shell glows like a banked fire. She nests deep in the [[hollow_trees]], where the last embers of the burn still smoulder, and treats them as her young.\n\nHer brood, the [[crawler]] and [[charger]], defend her. She blocks the [[wanderer]]'s climb to the [[moonlit_canopy]]. She is not evil, only protective of the warmth; the moon's cold light is her enemy.\n\nOpen question: what the player gains by defeating her.",
    "fields": {
     "role": "boss",
     "region": "Hollow trees",
     "motivation": "Guard the last warm embers of the forest"
    },
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "ash_floor",
    "kind": "place",
    "title": "Ash Floor",
    "summary": "The burned forest floor where the Wanderer awakens.",
    "body": "The Wanderer wakes among blackened stumps and ash drifts. Smoke hides the sky, but the moon shows faintly through it.\n\nHome to [[crawler]]s. The area teaches basic movement and the first look at the world. Huge roots and burned trunks rise toward the [[hollow_trees]].",
    "fields": {
     "mood": "Silent, grey, drifting ash with faint ember glow",
     "appearance": "Charred stumps, ash drifts, dead roots, a distant moon through smoke",
     "role": "Starting region"
    },
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "hollow_trees",
    "kind": "place",
    "title": "Hollow Trees",
    "summary": "Giant burned-out trunks, hollow inside, nested by the cinder beetles.",
    "body": "The Wanderer climbs inside the huge trunks that survived the fire as shells. Tunnels and shafts glow with embers.\n\nChargers and Crawlers ([[charger]], [[crawler]]) patrol here. At the heart is the nest of the [[cinder_queen]], whose defeat opens the way to the [[moonlit_canopy]]. Connects down to the [[ash_floor]].",
    "fields": {
     "mood": "Claustrophobic, warm, orange-lit, dangerous",
     "appearance": "Vertical shafts inside huge hollow trunks, glowing embers, resin and honeycombed beetle tunnels",
     "role": "Middle region, boss: Cinder Beetle Queen"
    },
    "status": "draft"
   },
   {
    "id": "moonlit_canopy",
    "kind": "place",
    "title": "Moonlit Canopy",
    "summary": "The living treetops under the moon, where the climb ends.",
    "body": "Above the smoke the canopy survived. Leaves are silver under a great moon, and the air is clear.\n\nReaching its top ends the [[wanderer]]'s journey. Whether the moon is a home, a grave or a rebirth is left open. It is reached by passing through the [[hollow_trees]].",
    "fields": {
     "mood": "Cold, open, serene, hopeful",
     "appearance": "Silver-lit leaves, wind, open sky, huge moon",
     "role": "Final region and ending"
    },
    "status": "draft"
   }
  ]
 },
